WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:06.842
(sighs)

00:00:12.472 --> 00:00:14.824
(clothes rustling)

00:00:16.947 --> 00:00:18.647
(keys jingling)

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.433
- Justin?

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:28.756
- Hey... I was just gonna

00:00:28.756 --> 00:00:30.926
head out. I had some things to do today.

00:00:30.926 --> 00:00:35.012
- Oh, you didn't want to get
like breakfast or something?

00:00:35.012 --> 00:00:38.079
- No, I don't think so. I'm not hungry.

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:38.960
I'm just gonna go.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.529
- Okay well let me get
dressed, I'll show you out.

00:00:40.529 --> 00:00:42.047
- No! Don't worry about it.

00:00:42.047 --> 00:00:44.212
I'll let myself out, it's easier...

00:00:44.212 --> 00:00:46.764
Same way I came in right? Just...

00:00:46.764 --> 00:00:49.374
It's easier... so.

00:00:49.374 --> 00:00:53.755
- Is this about last night?

00:00:53.755 --> 00:00:56.640
- No.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.101
Yes, I don't know.

00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:01.771
I just, I don't want to
talk about last night.

00:01:01.771 --> 00:01:03.521
This was a one time thing.

00:01:03.521 --> 00:01:06.979
- I mean it felt pretty real to me.

00:01:06.979 --> 00:01:10.434
- What? We had a lot to drink okay?

00:01:10.434 --> 00:01:13.772
And...

00:01:13.772 --> 00:01:16.651
Mistakes happen when you drink that much.

00:01:16.651 --> 00:01:20.099
- Mistake? This was a mistake to you?

00:01:20.099 --> 00:01:22.042
- No, that's not what I'm saying.

00:01:22.042 --> 00:01:25.086
I'm just, I'm not ready for this.

00:01:25.086 --> 00:01:26.129
You know?

00:01:26.129 --> 00:01:28.173
I didn't sign up for something so serious.

00:01:28.173 --> 00:01:29.419
- But last night you said--

00:01:29.419 --> 00:01:31.750
- I'm embarrassed about last night!

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.797
(laughs)

00:01:34.797 --> 00:01:36.918
My side. I'm gonna sleep like this.

00:01:36.918 --> 00:01:38.933
- You're not sleeping on the bed, I--

00:01:38.933 --> 00:01:40.769
- I'm bout to, I don't
like, I don't move much--

00:01:40.769 --> 00:01:42.630
- You don't like hardwood ground?

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:44.134
- A little bit of room.

00:01:44.134 --> 00:01:47.291
- You're my brother to me.

00:01:47.291 --> 00:01:49.852
We're brothers.

00:01:49.852 --> 00:01:51.445
- I love you like my brother.

00:01:51.445 --> 00:01:53.323
- It's not weird, we love each other--

00:01:53.323 --> 00:01:53.833
- Yeah

00:01:53.833 --> 00:01:55.179
- It's cool, we love each other

00:01:55.179 --> 00:01:56.150
- Honestly, we should say this like

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:58.651
every day to each other, we
love each other you know?

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:01.089
- I wanna wake up in the
morning and every day

00:02:01.089 --> 00:02:02.881
just text you, "I love you,
hope you have a good day."

00:02:02.881 --> 00:02:03.807
- Why don't we do that?

00:02:03.807 --> 00:02:04.740
- We should do it.

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:07.444
I mean, I'm a little embarrassed too.

00:02:07.444 --> 00:02:08.294
But... I don't--

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:10.089
- [Justin] Look, this is weird.

00:02:10.089 --> 00:02:13.116
Like what happened last night? You know?

00:02:13.116 --> 00:02:17.256
I don't do that, like
talk about those things.

00:02:17.256 --> 00:02:18.680
Like feelings or whatever.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:20.475
I don't know man, I just like felt

00:02:20.475 --> 00:02:22.019
like lonely for a long time

00:02:22.019 --> 00:02:25.960
and like didn't really have anyone

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.372
like real in my life, you know?

00:02:28.372 --> 00:02:29.375
- [Zack] Yeah

00:02:29.375 --> 00:02:33.352
- And it was just like...
I don't know if I could've

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:35.518
gotten through this without you, you know?

00:02:35.518 --> 00:02:39.306
So... you know... thank you.

00:02:39.306 --> 00:02:39.833
- Yeah.

00:02:39.833 --> 00:02:44.121
- Like you know we can't go
back to how things were right?

00:02:44.121 --> 00:02:47.256
Those days are over, like
everything's changed now.

00:02:47.256 --> 00:02:50.581
- Yeah. I know.

00:02:50.581 --> 00:02:53.941
I don't wanna go back.

00:02:53.941 --> 00:02:55.469
I've never had a friend like that

00:02:55.469 --> 00:02:58.638
who I can just talk to.

00:02:58.638 --> 00:03:01.899
I really liked last night

00:03:01.899 --> 00:03:04.728
and I don't regret it.

00:03:04.728 --> 00:03:06.729
I don't regret anything I said.

00:03:06.729 --> 00:03:11.729
That's not why you be your
friends with people, you...

00:03:11.809 --> 00:03:14.504
(heavy breathing)

00:03:17.824 --> 00:03:21.700
Love you like a brother.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.149
(exhales)

00:03:23.149 --> 00:03:27.403
- Okay.

00:03:27.403 --> 00:03:28.455
So what now?

00:03:28.455 --> 00:03:33.022
What, what, how do we do this?

00:03:33.022 --> 00:03:34.788
- Wanna go get breakfast?

00:03:34.788 --> 00:03:37.928
(snickers)

00:03:37.928 --> 00:03:40.687
- Yeah

00:03:40.687 --> 00:03:42.265
- Mickey D's or Denny's?

00:03:42.265 --> 00:03:44.467
- You know I'm a Mickey D's guy.

00:03:44.467 --> 00:03:45.591
- [Zack] We're goin to Denny's.

00:03:45.591 --> 00:03:48.144
(laughs)

00:03:48.144 --> 00:03:50.539
- [Zack] Yo Cavs Clippers
tonight, who you got?

00:03:50.539 --> 00:03:52.223
- [Justin] Man you know Kyrie's my dude.

00:03:52.223 --> 00:03:53.526
- [Zack] Wait, Kyrie's hurt.

00:03:53.526 --> 00:03:55.185
- [Justin] What!? Since when?

00:03:55.185 --> 00:03:56.905
- [Zack] Since the fin--

